        "heading": "ARSENAL + HENRY v PSG",
        "sub": "An imagined match · a prediction",
        "pill": "WHO WOULD WIN?",
        "person": "henry"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This one is personal. PSG beat Arsenal on penalties in the Champions League final in Budapest this May.",
